{
  "name": "Fee overrides: a market free for a day, an account free forever, priority and its ties",
  "rules": ["E-7.10", "E-7.11", "E-8.2", "E-10.11", "E-10.12"],
  "notes": [
    "The default schedule is maker 0, taker 70 000 (7%). Every trade is 10 contracts at 50c: yes 500, no 500, cash -500 for each side, 10 minted.",
    "At 7% the taker pays ceil(70000 * 500 * 500 / 10^9) = ceil(17.5) = 18; at 1%, ceil(2.5) = 3.",
    "Step 1: override 1, priority 10, instrument 1000 for every account, both rates 0, expiring a day later. Step 2: override 2, priority 5, account 3 for everything, both rates 0, never expiring.",
    "Step 4: on 1000, override 1 matches both A and B: no fees, and account 0 is untouched.",
    "Step 6: on 1010 nothing matches A or B: the default applies, B the taker pays 18.",
    "Step 8: C sells on 1010; override 2 matches C: C pays nothing. A, the maker, pays the default maker rate 0. Each party resolves on its own.",
    "Step 9: override 3 has the same priority 5 as override 2 and also matches C on 1010, at 3.5%. Step 11: the tie goes to the lower ID, 2, so C still pays nothing.",
    "Step 12: override 4, priority 1, event 101 for every account, maker 0, taker 1%. Step 14: it beats override 2 for C, who pays 3; it also wins for A, at maker rate 0. Naming the account does not outrank a lower priority.",
    "Steps 15 and 16: override 4 is removed; removing it again is rejected. Step 17: an override whose expiry is not later than now is rejected.",
    "Step 18 advances a day: override 1 is no longer active. Step 19: removing it is rejected, as for an override that does not exist.",
    "Step 21: on 1000 again, B is charged the default 18. B is short 10 so sReduce is 0 and cash is still -500. B: 8982 - 500 - 18 = 8464. Account 0: 21 + 18 = 39.",
    "Balances: A spends 500 on each of six bids, 10000 to 7000. C: 10000 - 500 - 500 - 500 - 3 = 8497."
  ],
  "setup": [
    {"op": "centTable", "tickTableId": 1},
    {"op": "binary", "eventId": 100, "instrumentId": 1000},
    {"op": "binary", "eventId": 101, "instrumentId": 1010},
    {"op": "fund", "accountId": 1, "cents": 10000},
    {"op": "fund", "accountId": 2, "cents": 10000},
    {"op": "fund", "accountId": 3, "cents": 10000},
    {"msg": "SetFeeSchedule", "makerRateMicros": 0, "takerRateMicros": 70000}
  ],
  "steps": [
    {"input": {"msg": "SetFeeOverride", "commandId": "o1", "overrideId": 1, "priority": 10, "accountId": 0, "instrumentId": 1000, "eventId": 0, "makerRateMicros": 0, "takerRateMicros": 0, "expiresAfterNs": 86400000000000},
     "expect": [
       {"msg": "CommandApplied", "commandId": "o1", "outcome": "APPLIED"}
     ]},
    {"input": {"msg": "SetFeeOverride", "commandId": "o2", "overrideId": 2, "priority": 5, "accountId": 3, "instrumentId": 0, "eventId": 0, "makerRateMicros": 0, "takerRateMicros": 0},
     "expect": [
       {"msg": "CommandApplied", "commandId": "o2", "outcome": "APPLIED"}
     ]},
    {"input": {"msg": "NewOrder", "accountId": 1, "clientOrderId": "a1", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "BUY", "tick": 49, "quantity": 10},
     "expect": [
       {"msg": "OrderAccepted", "orderId": "O1", "accountId": 1, "clientOrderId": "a1", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "BUY", "tick": 49, "quantity": 10, "reservedCents": 500},
       {"msg": "SleeveChanged", "accountId": 1, "availableCents": 9500, "reservedCents": 500},
       {"msg": "BookLevelChanged", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "BUY", "tick": 49, "quantity": 10, "orderCount": 1}
     ]},
    {"input": {"msg": "NewOrder", "accountId": 2, "clientOrderId": "b1", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "SELL", "tick": 49, "quantity": 10},
     "expect": [
       {"msg": "OrderAccepted", "orderId": "O2", "accountId": 2, "clientOrderId": "b1", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "SELL", "tick": 49, "quantity": 10, "reservedCents": 500},
       {"msg": "Fill", "tradeId": "T1", "instrumentId": 1000, "tick": 49, "quantity": 10, "makerOrderId": "O1", "makerAccountId": 1, "makerRemaining": 0, "takerOrderId": "O2", "takerAccountId": 2, "takerRemaining": 0, "takerSide": "SELL", "mintedPairs": 10, "burnedPairs": 0, "buyerCashCents": -500, "sellerCashCents": -500, "makerFeeCents": 0, "takerFeeCents": 0},
       {"msg": "PositionChanged", "accountId": 1, "instrumentId": 1000, "position": 10},
       {"msg": "PositionChanged", "accountId": 2, "instrumentId": 1000, "position": -10},
       {"msg": "SleeveChanged", "accountId": 1, "availableCents": 9500, "reservedCents": 0},
       {"msg": "SleeveChanged", "accountId": 2, "availableCents": 9500, "reservedCents": 0},
       {"msg": "BookLevelChanged", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "BUY", "tick": 49, "quantity": 0, "orderCount": 0}
     ]},
    {"input": {"msg": "NewOrder", "accountId": 1, "clientOrderId": "a2", "instrumentId": 1010, "side": "BUY", "tick": 49, "quantity": 10},
     "expect": [
       {"msg": "OrderAccepted", "orderId": "O3", "accountId": 1, "clientOrderId": "a2", "instrumentId": 1010, "side": "BUY", "tick": 49, "quantity": 10, "reservedCents": 500},
       {"msg": "SleeveChanged", "accountId": 1, "availableCents": 9000, "reservedCents": 500},
       {"msg": "BookLevelChanged", "instrumentId": 1010, "side": "BUY", "tick": 49, "quantity": 10, "orderCount": 1}
     ]},
    {"input": {"msg": "NewOrder", "accountId": 2, "clientOrderId": "b2", "instrumentId": 1010, "side": "SELL", "tick": 49, "quantity": 10},
     "expect": [
       {"msg": "OrderAccepted", "orderId": "O4", "accountId": 2, "clientOrderId": "b2", "instrumentId": 1010, "side": "SELL", "tick": 49, "quantity": 10, "reservedCents": 500},
       {"msg": "Fill", "tradeId": "T2", "instrumentId": 1010, "tick": 49, "quantity": 10, "makerOrderId": "O3", "makerAccountId": 1, "makerRemaining": 0, "takerOrderId": "O4", "takerAccountId": 2, "takerRemaining": 0, "takerSide": "SELL", "mintedPairs": 10, "burnedPairs": 0, "buyerCashCents": -500, "sellerCashCents": -500, "makerFeeCents": 0, "takerFeeCents": 18},
       {"msg": "PositionChanged", "accountId": 1, "instrumentId": 1010, "position": 10},
       {"msg": "PositionChanged", "accountId": 2, "instrumentId": 1010, "position": -10},
       {"msg": "SleeveChanged", "accountId": 0, "availableCents": 18, "reservedCents": 0},
       {"msg": "SleeveChanged", "accountId": 1, "availableCents": 9000, "reservedCents": 0},
       {"msg": "SleeveChanged", "accountId": 2, "availableCents": 8982, "reservedCents": 0},
       {"msg": "BookLevelChanged", "instrumentId": 1010, "side": "BUY", "tick": 49, "quantity": 0, "orderCount": 0}
     ]},
    {"input": {"msg": "NewOrder", "accountId": 1, "clientOrderId": "a3", "instrumentId": 1010, "side": "BUY", "tick": 49, "quantity": 10},
     "expect": [
       {"msg": "OrderAccepted", "orderId": "O5", "accountId": 1, "clientOrderId": "a3", "instrumentId": 1010, "side": "BUY", "tick": 49, "quantity": 10, "reservedCents": 500},
       {"msg": "SleeveChanged", "accountId": 1, "availableCents": 8500, "reservedCents": 500},
